@title Heat with no loss data on any device draws no field, no numbers and says why
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Laptop test finding 7: before any part data the Heat map showed a 35 to 50 degree gradient and a "Plate by Q1 46 C, +4 K" card while the legend said devices had no loss data. The fixture (qa/fixtures/make_no_loss_fixture.py) is the hot cabinet with no device loss. The hot-spot cards, badges and the field are painted, so the picture (heat-no-data) is the evidence; the legend text is checked.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-no-loss-data.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text show or hide heat
wait 6
key Enter
wait 20
shot heat-no-data
expect "No heat picture yet"
expect_not "Plate by"
check_layout
